DTEND:20260827T220000Z
LOCATION:GLOBAL &amp\; INTERNATIONAL STUDIES BUILDING
GEO:39.170002;-86.517492
SUMMARY:Hamilton Lugar Induction Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:During the ceremony\, you'll:Hear brief remarks from HLS lead
 ers about the school's history\, values\, and mission.  Meet mentors and 
 members of the HLS community.  Take part in an HLS tradition celebrating 
 international cooperation\, curiosity\, resilience\, and student engageme
 nt.  Reflect on our shared commitment to human rights\, justice\, peace\,
  and prosperity.    Come ready to listen\, learn\, engage\, and embrace H
 LS as your community as you begin your journey toward becoming the next g
 eneration of global leaders and researchers.Attendance is expected for al
 l incoming Hamilton Lugar School students.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<h5 class="isSelectedEnd">  During the cerem
 ony\, you'll:</h5><ul data-spread="false"><li>Hear brief remarks from HLS
  leaders about the school's history\, values\, and mission.  </li><li>Mee
 t mentors and members of the HLS community.  </li><li>Take part in an HLS
  tradition celebrating international cooperation\, curiosity\, resilience
 \, and student engagement.  </li><li>Reflect on our shared commitment to 
 human rights\, justice\, peace\, and prosperity.  </li></ul><p>  Come rea
 dy to <strong>listen\, learn\, engage\, and embrace HLS as your community
 </strong> as you begin your journey toward becoming the next generation o
 f global leaders and researchers.</p><p><em><strong>Attendance is expecte
 d for all incoming Hamilton Lugar School students.</strong></em></p>
UID:20260827T210000Z-2313470@events.iu.edu
DTSTAMP:20260529T144845Z
URL:https://events.iu.edu/hls/event/2313470-hamilton-lugar-induction-cere
 mony
LAST-MODIFIED:20260818T204226Z
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2313470
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
X-LIVEWHALE-COST:Free
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  Samson Lotven (<a href="mailto:slotven@iu
 .edu">slotven@iu.edu</a>)\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Join us for our <strong>Induction Ceremony</st
 rong>\, where we'll welcome our newest students into the Hamilton Lugar S
 chool community and introduce you to the mentors who will help you chart 
 your college journey.\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-TAGS:Community engagement|Fall Semester|hls internal calendar
 |HLS|Hoosier Welcome|Orientation|Undergrad Events
