SUMMARY:Hamilton Lugar Backyard Party
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the Hamilton Lugar School! Whether you're new to H
 LS or returning for another year\, come celebrate the start of the semest
 er with friends\, classmates\, faculty\, and staff.  &#127926\; Live Musi
 c from Matixando (https://www.matixando.org/)  &#127790\; Food Trucks  &#
 127912\; Tie Dye Shirts  &#127952\; Lawn Games&#160\;  &#129309\; Meet Yo
 ur HLS Community — connect with students\, faculty\, instructors\, TAs\
 , and staff  Bring a blanket or beach towel\, hang out on the lawn\, grab
  some food\, enjoy the music\, and make new connections!Open to all Hamil
 ton Lugar undergraduate and graduate students\, faculty\, and staff. Brin
 g your friends and come celebrate Welcome Week with HLS!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p class="isSelectedEnd">  Welcome to the Ha
 milton Lugar School! Whether you're new to HLS or returning for another y
 ear\, come celebrate the start of the semester with friends\, classmates\
 , faculty\, and staff.</p><p class="isSelectedEnd">  &#127926\; <strong>L
 ive Music</strong> from <a href="https://www.matixando.org/">Matixando</a
 ><br />  &#127790\; <strong>Food Trucks</strong><br />  &#127912\; <stron
 g>Tie Dye Shirts</strong><br />  &#127952\; <strong>Lawn Games</strong>&#
 160\;<br />  &#129309\; <strong>Meet Your HLS Community</strong> — conn
 ect with students\, faculty\, instructors\, TAs\, and staff</p><p class="
 isSelectedEnd">  Bring a blanket or beach towel\, hang out on the lawn\, 
 grab some food\, enjoy the music\, and make new connections!</p><p><stron
 g>Open to all Hamilton Lugar undergraduate and graduate students\, facult
 y\, and staff. Bring your friends and come celebrate Welcome Week with HL
 S!</strong></p>
