 <p class="intro" data-path-to-node="14">  Ambassador Lee Feinstein is a S
 enior Managing Director and the President of McLarty Associates. He previ
 ously served as the U.S. Ambassador to the Republic of Poland and held se
 nior positions at the Department of State\, including Principal Deputy Di
 rector and a Member of the Policy Planning Staff. He was the Founding Dea
