 ode="16\,2\,0" data-index-in-node="0">The Roadmap:</strong> A technical w
 alkthrough of the <strong data-path-to-node="16\,2\,0" data-index-in-node
 ="44">October 15 application deadline</strong> and the <strong>2027 semes
 ter start date</strong> for the Spring cohort.    </p></li></ul><p data-p
 ath-to-node="16\,2\,0">  We know your schedule is tight. Drop in for 20 m
 inutes to grab lunch and the <strong>"HLS D.C. Guide"</strong>\, or stay 
 for the full discussion.</p><p data-path-to-node="16\,2\,0">  &#160\;</p>
