 y with two former Senior Foreign Service officers and global executive le
 aders:</p><ul data-path-to-node="15"><li><p data-path-to-node="15\,0\,0">
 <strong data-path-to-node="15\,0\,0" data-index-in-node="0">A Former Dire
 ctor for Global Rapid Response at Google (YouTube Trust &amp\; Safety):</
 strong> A career diplomat who served in the White House Situation Room an
